\[
\boxed{\frac{-(5b + \sqrt{5(5b^2 - 16a)})}{2a}} \quad \text{and} \quad \boxed{\frac{-(5b - \sqrt{5(5b^2 - 16a)})}{2a}}
\]

Alternatively, without factoring the discriminant:
\[
\boxed{\frac{-(5b + \sqrt{25b^2 - 80a})}{2a}} \quad \text{and} \quad \boxed{\frac{-(5b - \sqrt{25b^2 - 80a})}{2a}}
\]
